      "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Critical Public Safety Principles:**\n> - **Official SMS Code:** The **ONLY** authentic shortcode used by BISP to dispatch payment alerts and eligibility status is **8171**.\n> - **No Mobile Numbers:** BISP never sends messages from ordinary 11-digit mobile numbers (e.g., `0300-XXXXXXX`, `0345-XXXXXXX`) or private WhatsApp accounts.\n> - **Free Service:** Checking your eligibility on the web portal or via 8171 SMS is completely free. Never transfer mobile balance, money, or fees to any caller claiming to release your installment.\n> - **Privacy Notice:** CareerDost does **not** collect CNIC numbers. Always verify directly on the official government website.",
