      "When active positions are notified on the portal, follow these steps to submit your application:\n\n1. **Register on the Portal:** Visit [sjp.gos.pk](https://sjp.gos.pk/) and create a new account using your CNIC, email address, and mobile number.\n2. **Build Your Candidate Profile:**\n   - Enter personal details, domicile district (Urban/Rural), and mailing address.\n   - Add educational qualifications starting from Matriculation to highest degree.\n   - Upload technical certificates (MS Office diploma) and typing credentials.\n3. **Upload Mandatory Scanned Documents:**\n   - CNIC front and back.\n   - Domicile and PRC (Form D).\n   - Passport-sized photograph with blue/white background.\n   - Academic marksheets and certificates.\n4. **Browse Active Departmental Openings:** Go to the 'Jobs' section on the dashboard to locate open Junior Clerk listings.\n5. **Apply & Submit:** Confirm eligibility against the department's requirements, submit the application, and retain the generated application tracking ID.",
      "## Important Precaution Against Unofficial Advertisements",
      "> [!CAUTION]\n> **Avoid Fake Recruitment Agents:**\n> - The Sindh Government does not hire through private agents or unverified WhatsApp groups.\n> - Always cross-check vacancy notices published in daily newspapers against listings on `sjp.gos.pk` or the recruiting department's official website.\n> - Never hand over original educational certificates or unverified cash payments.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
      "**Q1: What is the official website for Sindh Job Portal?**\nThe official address is [sjp.gos.pk](https://sjp.gos.pk/).\n\n**Q2: What is the basic pay scale for Junior Clerk in Sindh?**\nJunior Clerk is categorized under **Basic Pay Scale 11 (BPS-11)** in provincial government departments.\n\n**Q3: Is a computer certificate compulsory for Junior Clerk?**\nYes. A recognized certificate in MS Office (at least 6 months) from an SBTE/TTB recognized technical institute and a minimum 30 wpm typing speed are statutory requirements.\n\n**Q4: How do I know if a specific department's clerk jobs are currently open?**\nCheck the live vacancies tab directly on [sjp.gos.pk](https://sjp.gos.pk/) or monitor official departmental advertisements.",
