    "logoInitial": "SESSI",
    "featuredImage": "/images/sessi-internship-programme-2026.jpg",
    "imageAlt": "SESSI Internship Programme 2026 – 30 Internship Positions in Karachi — Sindh Employees' Social Security Institution (SESSI) Official Notice CareerDost",
    "excerpt": "Sindh Employees' Social Security Institution (SESSI) announces 30 structured internship positions at its Head Office in Karachi. Open for fresh graduates holding Sindh domicile across 6 key disciplines. Apply online before 10 October 2026.",
    "content": [
      "### Overview & Official Announcement",
      "The **Sindh Employees' Social Security Institution (SESSI)**, operating under the Labour & Human Resource Department, Government of Sindh, has officially launched the **SESSI Structured Internship Programme 2026** (Advertisement Reference: `SESSI/INT/2026/01`). This prestigious provincial initiative provides **30 structured internship positions** designed to furnish fresh graduates and postgraduates with practical, training-oriented experience in public sector social security governance and healthcare administration.",
      "All selected interns will be posted at the **SESSI Head Office, Karachi**, where they will work under the direct mentorship of seasoned civil administrators, legal officers, and technical specialists.",
      "### Quick Information Summary Table",
      "- **Administering Body:** Sindh Employees' Social Security Institution (SESSI)\n- **Programme Title:** SESSI Structured Internship Programme 2026\n- **Reference Number:** SESSI/INT/2026/01\n- **Total Positions:** 30 Vacancies\n- **Primary Location:** SESSI Head Office, Karachi\n- **Target Group:** Fresh / Recent Graduates and Postgraduates\n- **Opening Date:** 01 October 2026\n- **Application Deadline:** 10 October 2026 (5 Days Remaining)\n- **Maximum Age Limit:** 28 Years (Calculated on closing date)\n- **Domicile Prerequisite:** Sindh Domicile & Permanent Residence Certificate (PRC)\n- **Application Fee:** Free of Cost (No application processing fee)\n- **Official Career Portal:** [jobs.sessi.gov.pk/opportunities/1](https://sessi.gov.pk/jobs.sessi.gov.pk/opportunities/1)\n- **Direct Application Link:** [jobs.sessi.gov.pk/apply/1](https://sessi.gov.pk/jobs.sessi.gov.pk/apply/1)",
      "### Available Disciplines & Categorical Allocation",
      "The 30 internship openings are distributed across six specialized professional tracks. Prospective candidates must note that **applications are permitted in one discipline only**:\n\n1. **Finance / Accounting / Audit:** BBA Finance, BS Accounting & Finance, M.Com, or equivalent.\n2. **Computer Science / IT / Data Science / Software Engineering:** BSCS, BS Software Engineering, BSIT, BS Data Science, or related computing degrees.\n3. **Procurement / Supply Chain:** BBA or Master's specializing in Supply Chain Management or Public Procurement.\n4. **Law:** LLB degree holders seeking practical experience in corporate labour laws and statutory governance.\n5. **Human Resource Management:** MBA in Human Resource Management (HRM) or equivalent postgraduate qualification.\n6. **Civil Engineering:** Bachelor of Civil Engineering (BE / BS Civil) exclusively allocated to the SESSI Engineering & Works Department.",
      "### Eligibility Criteria & Academic Requirements",
      "Applicants must strictly satisfy the following eligibility criteria stipulated in the official SESSI charter:\n- **Recent Graduate Status:** The candidate's qualifying degree must have been completed within the **preceding two (02) years** from the application closing date.\n- **Completed Degree Mandatory:** Candidates must have already completed their qualifying degree. Students awaiting their final examination results or thesis defence are **strictly not eligible**.\n- **Age Ceiling:** Not more than **28 years of age** on 10 October 2026. Age calculation is performed automatically through the portal using the candidate's date of birth.\n- **Provincial Domicile:** Candidates must possess a valid **Sindh Domicile** and **PRC (Form D)**.\n- **Work Experience:** No prior professional work experience is required. This programme is designed exclusively as an entry-level capacity building opportunity.",
      "### Required Documents for Online Upload",
      "Before initiating the online application, applicants should prepare clear scanned copies (in PDF, JPG, or PNG format, maximum 5.00 MB per file) of the following mandatory documents:\n1. Recent passport-size photograph with white background\n2. Computerized National Identity Card (CNIC) — Front side\n3. Computerized National Identity Card (CNIC) — Back side\n4. Sindh Domicile Certificate\n5. Degree or Provisional Degree Certificate from an HEC-recognized university\n6. Final Academic Transcript / Detailed Marks Certificate (DMC)\n7. Relevant Professional Training Certificates (Optional)",
      "### Step-by-Step Online Application Procedure",
      "1. **Access the Official Portal:** Navigate to the official SESSI Recruitment & Internship portal at `https://sessi.gov.pk/jobs.sessi.gov.pk/apply/1`.\n2. **Select Your Track:** Choose your qualifying discipline from the six eligible tracks. Remember, candidates can apply for only one discipline.\n3. **Fill Personal Credentials:** Enter your full name, CNIC number, date of birth, domicile district, mobile contact, and active email address.\n4. **Provide Academic Credentials:** Enter your university name, graduation passing year, total marks/CGPA, and degree title.\n5. **Upload Mandatory Documents:** Attach your photograph, CNIC, domicile, degree certificate, and final transcript.\n6. **Review and Submit:** Verify all entered data and click Submit. Download and save the electronic acknowledgement slip and Application ID for future reference.",
      "### Important Statutory Instructions",
      "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Training Placement Clause:** The SESSI Structured Internship Programme is exclusively a temporary, training-oriented initiative. Participation shall not confer any legal right or claim for regular appointment, absorption, seniority, pension, or continuation of service within SESSI or the Government of Sindh.\n\n- Applications received through postal mail, courier, email, or by hand will be rejected without processing.\n- Only one application per CNIC is accepted by the digital system.\n- Incomplete applications lacking mandatory document attachments will be disqualified automatically.",
      "### Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
      "**Q1: What is the last date to apply for the SESSI Internship Programme 2026?**\nThe final deadline for online application submission is **10 October 2026** at 11:59 PM PST.\n\n**Q2: What is the maximum age limit for SESSI Internship applicants?**\nThe maximum age limit is **28 years** as of the closing date, 10 October 2026.\n\n**Q3: Can candidates with a pending result apply?**\nNo. Candidates must possess their completed degree or provisional degree certificate. Result-awaiting applicants are not eligible.\n\n**Q4: Is there an application fee for the SESSI Internship?**\nNo, there is no application processing fee. Registration is completely free on the official SESSI portal.\n\n**Q5: Can non-Sindh domicile holders apply?**\nNo. Only candidates holding a valid Sindh Domicile and Permanent Residence Certificate (PRC) are eligible.\n\n**Q6: Can I apply for multiple disciplines?**\nNo. The system restricts candidates to a single discipline application per CNIC."
    ],
