      "### Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
      "**Q1: When does NUST NET 2027 Series-1 registration start and close?**\nRegistration opens today, **4 October 2026**, and closes on **14 November 2026**.\n\n**Q2: When will Series-1 tests be conducted?**\nComputer-based tests (CBNET) will commence from **17 November 2026 onwards**.\n\n**Q3: Where is the test centre for Series-1?**\nNET Series-1 is conducted exclusively as a computer-based test at the NUST Main Campus (Sector H-12), Islamabad.\n\n**Q4: Is there negative marking in NUST NET?**\nNo. There is no negative marking in any section of the NUST Entry Test.\n\n**Q5: Can I appear in more than one NET series?**\nYes. You can appear in multiple series. You must submit a separate form and fee for each series, and your best score will be counted for final merit.",
      "**Q6: What is the fee for NET 2027 Series-1?**\nThe application fee is Rs. 5,000 for Pakistani and dual-nationality candidates, and USD 80 (Rs. 10,000) for foreign nationals."
